<title>UK: Allgemeine Deutsche sets 200 mln mark four-yr FRN.</title>
<headline>Allgemeine Deutsche sets 200 mln mark four-yr FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLGEMEINE DEUTSCHE DIREKTBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   SPREAD     12.5 BP   MATURITY    30 OCT.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    30 OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   30 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     LIST FEE    10 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
